// This repository packages UX ergonomics capabilities for Amplifier: a small team of
// specialist reviewers (usability, accessibility, evidence research, human-agent design)
// that can be composed onto any Amplifier session, plus two experiments that fork the
// bundle to test how the specialists perform.
